{"id":"011094b454369426","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth.md","title":"自由变量、赋值更新与 QBF 真值","display":"df-qbf-binding-and-truth — 自由变量、赋值更新与 QBF 真值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth","aliases":["73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth"],"display":"df-qbf-binding-and-truth — 自由变量、赋值更新与 QBF 真值","depends_on":["[[73-df-qbf-prefix-syntax]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.2–11.3, print pp. 487–501; PDF pp. 509–523; local resource/coding interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§13.4, p. 344; scan 352; local recursive semantics","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-qbf-binding-and-truth — 自由变量、赋值更新与 QBF 真值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"57a963ee40430dff\" href=\"?note=57a963ee40430dff\" title=\"73-df-qbf-prefix-syntax\">73-df-qbf-prefix-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.2–11.3, print pp. 487–501; PDF pp. 509–523; local resource/coding interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§13.4, p. 344; scan 352; local recursive semantics"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{QForm}\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{QForm}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbf2\">\\(b\\in\\mathbf2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbf2\">\\(\\nu:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbf2\\)</span>。语法构造子及唯一解析见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"57a963ee40430dff\" href=\"?note=57a963ee40430dff\" title=\"73-df-qbf-prefix-syntax\">73-df-qbf-prefix-syntax</a>；以下递归按严格子公式进行。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{QForm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{QForm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}:\\mathsf{QForm}\\to\\mathbf2\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}:\\mathsf{QForm}\\to\\mathbf2\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}binding\\text{-}and\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\nu[i\\mapsto b](j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b,&amp;j=i,\\\\\\nu(j),&amp;j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\nu_0(j)\\coloneqq0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}binding\\text{-}and\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\nu[i\\mapsto b](j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b,&amp;j=i,\\\\\\nu(j),&amp;j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\nu_0(j)\\coloneqq0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}binding\\text{-}and\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FV}(q_v(i))\\coloneqq\\{i\\},\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(q_{\\neg}(\\varphi))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(q_{\\wedge}(\\varphi,\\psi))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(q_{\\vee}(\\varphi,\\psi))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}binding\\text{-}and\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FV}(q_v(i))\\coloneqq\\{i\\},\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(q_{\\neg}(\\varphi))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(q_{\\wedge}(\\varphi,\\psi))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}(q_{\\vee}(\\varphi,\\psi))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}binding\\text{-}and\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FV}(q_{\\exists}(i,\\varphi))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{i\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}(q_{\\forall}(i,\\varphi))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{i\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}binding\\text{-}and\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FV}(q_{\\exists}(i,\\varphi))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{i\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}(q_{\\forall}(i,\\varphi))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{i\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}binding\\text{-}and\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(q_v(i))\\coloneqq\\nu(i),\\quad\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(q_{\\neg}(\\varphi))\\coloneqq1-\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\varphi),\\quad\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(q_{\\wedge}(\\varphi,\\psi))\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\varphi),\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\psi)\\},\\quad\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(q_{\\vee}(\\varphi,\\psi))\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\varphi),\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\psi)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}binding\\text{-}and\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(q_v(i))\\coloneqq\\nu(i),\\quad\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(q_{\\neg}(\\varphi))\\coloneqq1-\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\varphi),\\quad\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(q_{\\wedge}(\\varphi,\\psi))\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\varphi),\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\psi)\\},\\quad\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(q_{\\vee}(\\varphi,\\psi))\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\varphi),\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\psi)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}binding\\text{-}and\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(q_{\\exists}(i,\\varphi))\\coloneqq\\max_{b\\in\\mathbf2}\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu[i\\mapsto b]}(\\varphi),\\qquad\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(q_{\\forall}(i,\\varphi))\\coloneqq\\min_{b\\in\\mathbf2}\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu[i\\mapsto b]}(\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}binding\\text{-}and\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(q_{\\exists}(i,\\varphi))\\coloneqq\\max_{b\\in\\mathbf2}\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu[i\\mapsto b]}(\\varphi),\\qquad\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(q_{\\forall}(i,\\varphi))\\coloneqq\\min_{b\\in\\mathbf2}\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu[i\\mapsto b]}(\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}binding\\text{-}and\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{TQBF}\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{QForm}:\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu_0}(\\varphi)=1\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}binding\\text{-}and\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{TQBF}\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{QForm}:\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu_0}(\\varphi)=1\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>赋值更新只在量词的子公式中使用，因此同名嵌套量词正确地遮蔽外层赋值，无须用未说明的文本替换。所有公式本来就是二进制词，非法编码自动不属于 TQBF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-qbf-prefix-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"57a963ee40430dff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-qbf-prefix-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-qbf-prefix-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"57a963ee40430dff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{QForm}$，$i,j\\in\\mathbb N$、$b\\in\\mathbf2$，$\\nu:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbf2$。语法构造子及唯一解析见 [[73-df-qbf-prefix-syntax]]；以下递归按严格子公式进行。$\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{QForm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathbb N)$，$\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}:\\mathsf{QForm}\\to\\mathbf2$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{QForm}","display":f